        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tim Rice, Kathy Acker, Elton John, Hans Zimmer\n- Works: The Lion King\n- Roles: author, lyricist, composer, novelist, poet, playwright, essayist\n- Awards: Academy Award, Golden Globe Award, Tony Award, Grammy Award\n\nFacts:\n- Tim Rice was born on 10 November 1944 and is an English author and lyricist.\n- Tim Rice won Academy, Golden Globe, Tony, and Grammy awards.\n- Kathy Acker was born on 18 April 1944 and died on 30 November 1997.\n- Kathy Acker was an American experimental novelist, punk poet, playwright, essayist, postmodernist, and sex-positive feminist writer.\n- The Lion King featured original songs written by composer Elton John and lyricist Tim Rice.\n- The Lion King featured original scores written by Hans Zimmer.",
